<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were unevenly steady. Demand moderate on light offerings. Top $61.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs.  59.50-60.50, few 61.00-61.50</p>
<p>US 2-3 230-260 lbs.  58.50-59.50</p>
<p>Sows: Unevenly steady. Top 54.00</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-400 lbs. 45.00-48.50, few 49.00</p>
<p>	 400-500 lbs. 48.00-50.00</p>
<p>	 500-600 lbs. 50.00-53.00</p>
<p>few over  600 lbs. 52.00-54.00</p>
</text>
